<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 07.160  Meetpoint Radiant Square Classic</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Reconstructed by Roland Arajs from top and bottom views on</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">whiteflash.com/about-diamonds/diamond-education/the-radiant-cut-diamond.htm</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">I make no claim that the design is the same as the original by Henry Grossbard.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.760</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">61 facets + 8 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">4-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.000  T/W = 0.647  U/W = 0.647</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.553 C/W = 0.139</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.324</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="410">pc07160.asc</tspan>
</text>
